# the peer-to-peer aggregation layer for the distributed AGI
spell swarm
version 0.1.0
book networking
genre aggregation
origin first-party
provides p2p-aggregation
provides peer-registry
provides contribution-ledger
requires sdr-transport
requires libc
source wubu_swarm.c
source wubu_swarm.h
source wubu_swarm_wire.c
source wubu_swarm_wire.h
test wubu_swarm_test.c
